An attribute run after a lone plus leads a sublist at the content column

```
- a
+
{x}
  - c
.
<ul>
  <li>a
+</li>
</ul>
<ul x="">
  <li>c</li>
</ul>
```

```
- a
+
{x
y}
  - c
.
<ul>
  <li>a
+</li>
</ul>
<ul x="" y="">
  <li>c</li>
</ul>
```

```
> - a
> +
> {x}
>   - c
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>a
+</li>
  </ul>
  <ul x="">
    <li>c</li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
```
